    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "coach_bb_brother_sp01_00",
      "hash64": "CD0659629AEB7A45",
      "text": "Hey, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]![VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 5,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "coach_bb_brother_sp01_01",
      "hash64": "CD0658629AEB7892",
      "text": "Man, it’s been a while since I’ve been here. And\\neveryone’s been talking to me like normal...\\r\\nI honestly wasn’t expecting that.[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 130,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "coach_bb_brother_sp01_02",
      "hash64": "CD0657629AEB76DF",
      "text": "Well, everyone but Drayton. He was looking at\\nme with a stupid grin on his face...[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "coach_bb_brother_sp01_03",
      "hash64": "CD0656629AEB752C",
      "text": "But I still apologized to him—for everything I did,\\nand how I acted...[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "coach_bb_brother_sp01_select_01",
      "hash64": "7B95975FE6DF1221",
      "text": "I’m glad things are working out!",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "coach_bb_brother_sp01_select_02",
      "hash64": "7B95945FE6DF0D08",
      "text": "You two getting along?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "coach_bb_brother_sp01_04",
      "hash64": "CD0655629AEB7379",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]Yeah, me too! It’s all thanks to you,\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)].[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BD06",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "coach_bb_brother_sp01_04b",
      "hash64": "4D36318D3E1496E1",
      "text": "Can’t really say we’re buddy-buddy just yet,\\nbut...yeah. I’ll keep trying...[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "coach_bb_brother_sp01_05",
      "hash64": "CD0654629AEB71C6",
      "text": "I’m gonna make up for the time I lost while I was\\naway from school—just you watch![VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "coach_bb_brother_sp02_00",
      "hash64": "2781177BE3515FF2",
      "text": "Hey, thanks for bringing Arven and everyone with\\nyou to Kitakami.[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "coach_bb_brother_sp02_01",
      "hash64": "2781187BE35161A5",
      "text": "Being back home on my break, I just couldn’t\\nstop dwelling on everything that had happened...\\r\\nIt was rough...[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 112,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "coach_bb_brother_sp02_02",
      "hash64": "2781157BE3515C8C",
      "text": "You guys visiting really helped.[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "coach_bb_brother_sp02_03",
      "hash64": "2781167BE3515E3F",
      "text": "It’s too bad all that weird stuff happened while\\nyou guys were there, though...[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "coach_bb_brother_sp02_select_03",
      "hash64": "A9DD7FFF7C8F6BAA",
      "text": "The weird stuff with Carmine?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "coach_bb_brother_sp02_select_04",
      "hash64": "A9DD7AFF7C8F632B",
      "text": "The weird “mochi mochi” stuff?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "coach_bb_brother_sp02_05",
      "hash64": "2781147BE3515AD9",
      "text": "Yeah, that! My sis is still all embarrassed ’bout it,\\nso you better not bring that stuff up around her![VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 103,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "coach_bb_brother_sp02_05b",
      "hash64": "71B08983433D2BC1",
      "text": "Yeah, that! It makes for a funny story now, but\\nwowzers, that was scary![VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "coach_bb_brother_sp02_06",
      "hash64": "2781117BE35155C0",
      "text": "Y’know, there’s something I’ve been thinking\\nabout for a while and...I think I made up my mind.[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "coach_bb_brother_sp02_07",
      "hash64": "2781127BE3515773",
      "text": "I’ll fill you in soon, I promise. Just wait a bit, OK?[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 54,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "coach_bb_brother_sp03_00",
      "hash64": "50B90D7098D3DCA3",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]Hey, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]!\\nGuess\\r\\nwhat\\r\\nI\\r\\ndid?!\\r\\nI\\r\\nhad\\r\\nthe\\r\\nBB\\r\\nLeague\\r\\ndrop me![VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
